अथ चेत्त्वमहङ्कारान्न श्रोष्यसि विनङ्‍क्ष्यसि ॥ ५८ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4771,\"bb\":4175,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/58/b4175/\",\"body_value\":\"mac-cittaḥ sarva-durgāṇi
